sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Admin / Organizer
    participant UI as Admin Dashboard
    participant W as MetaMask
    participant SC as Smart Contract
    participant BC as Blockchain

    Note over A,BC: STEP 1: Create Election

    A->>UI: Fill election form<br/>(title, desc, times, config)
    A->>UI: Click "Create Election"
    UI->>SC: createElection(title, desc, start, end, config)
    SC->>W: Request signature
    W->>A: Approve
    W->>BC: Submit tx
    SC->>BC: Emit ElectionCreated
    BC-->>UI: Confirmed (electionId)

    Note over A,BC: STEP 2: Add Candidates

    A->>UI: Enter candidate name + description
    A->>UI: Click "Add Candidate"
    UI->>SC: addCandidate(electionId, name, desc)
    SC->>BC: Emit CandidateAdded
    BC-->>UI: Confirmed

    A->>UI: Repeat for all candidates

    Note over A,BC: STEP 3: Authorize Voters

    A->>UI: Enter voter address(es)
    A->>UI: Click "Authorize"
    UI->>SC: authorizeVotersBatch(electionId, addresses[])
    SC->>BC: Emit VoterAuthorized (per voter)
    BC-->>UI: Confirmed

    Note over A,BC: STEP 4: Start Election

    A->>UI: Click "Start Election"
    UI->>SC: startElection(electionId)
    SC->>SC: Verify: status=Pending, candidates>=2
    SC->>BC: Emit ElectionStarted
    BC-->>UI: Confirmed (status=Active)

    Note over A,BC: STEP 5: End Election

    A->>UI: Click "End Election"
    UI->>SC: endElection(electionId)
    SC->>BC: Emit ElectionEnded
    BC-->>UI: Confirmed (status=Ended)

    Note over A,BC: STEP 6: Finalize

    A->>UI: Click "Finalize Election"
    UI->>SC: finalizeElection(electionId)
    SC->>SC: Calculate results + tie-break
    SC->>BC: Emit ElectionFinalized
    BC-->>UI: Confirmed (winner + status)
